OL,3,AEx-bankers jailed for rigging rates
OL,4,Ahave convictions quashed
OL,5,
OL,6,FFive former Barclays traders sentenced
OL,7,Fin one of the biggest scandals of the
OL,8,Ffinancial crisis have had their
OL,9,Fconvictions overturned following a
OL,10,Flong-running legal battle.
OL,12,FJay Merchant, Jonathan Mathew, Philippe
OL,13,FMoryoussef, Alex Pabon, Colin
OL,14,FBermingham were convicted following
OL,15,Ftrials for manipulating the interest
OL,16,Frates used for loans between banks.
