OL,3,AEx-bankers jailed for rigging rates
OL,4,Ahave convictions quashed
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut their convictions were quashed on
OL,7,FWednesday by the Court of Appeal. The
OL,8,Fruling came after two other former City
OL,9,Ftraders had their convictions
OL,10,Foverturned last year, which paved the
OL,11,Fway for others to appeal.
OL,13,FThe traders were cast by prosecutors as
OL,14,Fa symbol of banker greed amid public
OL,15,Fbacklash and anger during the 2008
OL,16,Ffinancial crisis.
